{
  "name": "sea turtle",
  "_about": "THE GREEN SEA TURTLE (2026-11-09, tools/creaturegen/dozen/seaturtle.py): the pond turtle at 3.2, its carapace flattened (.6) and drawn out (1.25) with the raised scutes gone and pale rays over the costals, the fore legs one swept-back `fin` flipper each on the leg bone (beating up and down), the hind legs short paddles, no claws, the head a third bigger and blunt, the hooked beak kept. Olive-brown shell, pale plastron, greenish-grey skin; loggerhead and hawksbill coats. Written whole by its script; nothing patches it after.",
